    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Owen Reilly presents to the rental market this incredible, strikingly designed, 2-bedroom 3-bathroom detached townhouse in Dublin 4. Recently constructed to the highest of standards including a Nibe exhaust air heat pump system, the property further features a 30m2 enclosed patio with lighting. Internally the property comprises a hallway, WC, open plan living/kitchen/dining area with floor to ceiling glazed sliding door to rear patio and utility on the ground floor. Upstairs, you will find two large double bedrooms with bespoke fitted wardrobes and both with en-suites.\r\n\r\nOn street permit parking is available.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended.\r\n\r\nMore about the location...\r\n\r\nThe convenience of this location cannot be overstated with a host of amenities nearby. Donnybrook, Ranelagh and Ballsbridge are a short stroll away with their trendy eateries, bars, shops and restaurants as well as excellent transport links on your doorstep. The city centre, St Stephens Green, the RDS, Herbert Park, Ranelagh Gardens and the Aviva stadium are also nearby."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Incredible detached townhouse in Dublin 4.\r\nLuxury fixtures and fittings throughout.\r\nTwo double bedrooms, both with en-suites.\r\nSeparate utility.\r\n30m2 enclosed rear patio with lighting.\r\nEnergy efficient Nibe heating system.\r\nPermit parking available.\r\nFantastic location in the centre of Donnybrook.\r\nWithin walking distance to a host of amenities.\r\nExcellent transport links surrounding you."
      },
      {
